In vanilla, at least, aggravate monster is neutralised by stealth; it is
largely trivial to obtain stealth. (Elven cloak, elven boots, divine
intervention, ring of stealth, and some classes have it as an intrinsic.)

And, of course, it is impossible to get teleportitis except as a result
of deliberate player action.  The unspoiled player should fall victim to
this not more than once per flavour of teleport-granting monster. (Don't
even eat tengu unless you can deal with acquiring teleportitis.)
